{"module":"/assets/explain/knowledge/inequality-properties.js","part":"figure","scope":"inequality-properties","title":"两条数轴：对两边做同一种运算，先后顺序变不变","note":"六种运算：加同一个数、乘正数、乘负数、取倒数、平方、两式相减。每种都用具体数代入（如 $1<3$），连线交叉就说明大小颠倒；只有乘负数、同号取倒数会变向，平方和相减不一定。","after":"multiplication","stylesheet":"/assets/explain/knowledge/inequality-properties.css","version":"55e330c018e9","html":"<div class=\"ip-explorer\">\n      <p class=\"ip-ask\">选一种运算，看两个数的先后顺序变不变：</p>\n      <div class=\"ip-ops\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"运算\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-ip-op=\"add\" aria-pressed=\"true\">两边加同一个数</button><button type=\"button\" data-ip-op=\"mulpos\" aria-pressed=\"false\">两边乘正数</button><button type=\"button\" data-ip-op=\"mulneg\" aria-pressed=\"false\">两边乘负数</button><button type=\"button\" data-ip-op=\"recip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">两边取倒数</button><button type=\"button\" data-ip-op=\"square\" aria-pressed=\"false\">两边平方</button><button type=\"button\" data-ip-op=\"sub\" aria-pressed=\"false\">两个不等式相减</button>\n      </div>\n      <section class=\"ip-panel\" data-ip-panel=\"add\">\n        <p class=\"ip-example\"><span data-math-text><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1&lt;3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span>，</span>两边加 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"ip-verdict keep\">方向不变</span></p>\n        <svg class=\"ip-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 138\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"两边加同一个数：上面是原来的两个数，下面是运算后的两个数\">\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"38\" class=\"ip-row\">原来</text>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"108\" class=\"ip-row\">之后</text>\n    <path d=\"M58 34H332\" class=\"ip-line\"/><path d=\"M84.15384615384616 28V40\" class=\"ip-tick zero\"/><path d=\"M124.46153846153847 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M164.76923076923077 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M205.07692307692307 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M245.3846153846154 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M285.6923076923077 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M326 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M58 104H332\" class=\"ip-line\"/><path d=\"M84.15384615384616 98V110\" class=\"ip-tick zero\"/><path d=\"M124.46153846153847 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M164.76923076923077 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M205.07692307692307 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M245.3846153846154 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M285.6923076923077 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M326 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/>\n    <text x=\"84.15384615384616\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ip-zero\">0</text>\n    <path d=\"M124.46153846153847 40L205.07692307692307 98\" class=\"ip-connector p0\"/><path d=\"M205.07692307692307 40L285.6923076923077 98\" class=\"ip-connector p1\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"124.46153846153847\" cy=\"34\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"ip-dot p0\"/><text x=\"117.46153846153847\" y=\"23\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"ip-label p0\">a = 1</text><circle cx=\"205.07692307692307\" cy=\"34\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"ip-dot p1\"/><text x=\"212.07692307692307\" y=\"23\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"ip-label p1\">b = 3</text><circle cx=\"205.07692307692307\" cy=\"104\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"ip-dot p0\"/><text x=\"198.07692307692307\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"ip-label p0\">a+2 = 3</text><circle cx=\"285.6923076923077\" cy=\"104\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"ip-dot p1\"/><text x=\"292.6923076923077\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"ip-label p1\">b+2 = 5</text>\n  </svg>\n        <p class=\"ip-rule\"><span class=\"ip-tag\">规则</span><span data-math-text><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&lt;b\\Rightarrow a+c&lt;b+c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span><small data-math-text>整体平移，先后顺序不变；减去同一个数也一样。</small></p>\n      </section><section class=\"ip-panel\" data-ip-panel=\"mulpos\" hidden>\n        <p class=\"ip-example\"><span data-math-text><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1&lt;3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span>，</span>两边乘 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"ip-verdict keep\">方向不变</span></p>\n        <svg class=\"ip-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 138\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"两边乘正数：上面是原来的两个数，下面是运算后的两个数\">\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"38\" class=\"ip-row\">原来</text>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"108\" class=\"ip-row\">之后</text>\n    <path d=\"M58 34H332\" class=\"ip-line\"/><path d=\"M81.46666666666667 28V40\" class=\"ip-tick zero\"/><path d=\"M116.4 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M151.33333333333331 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M186.26666666666665 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M221.2 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M256.1333333333333 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M291.06666666666666 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M326 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M58 104H332\" class=\"ip-line\"/><path d=\"M81.46666666666667 98V110\" class=\"ip-tick zero\"/><path d=\"M116.4 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M151.33333333333331 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M186.26666666666665 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M221.2 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M256.1333333333333 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M291.06666666666666 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M326 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/>\n    <text x=\"81.46666666666667\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ip-zero\">0</text>\n    <path d=\"M116.4 40L151.33333333333331 98\" class=\"ip-connector p0\"/><path d=\"M186.26666666666665 40L291.06666666666666 98\" class=\"ip-connector p1\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"116.4\" cy=\"34\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"ip-dot p0\"/><text x=\"109.4\" y=\"23\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"ip-label p0\">a = 1</text><circle cx=\"186.26666666666665\" cy=\"34\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"ip-dot p1\"/><text x=\"193.26666666666665\" y=\"23\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"ip-label p1\">b = 3</text><circle cx=\"151.33333333333331\" cy=\"104\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"ip-dot p0\"/><text x=\"144.33333333333331\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"ip-label p0\">2a = 2</text><circle cx=\"291.06666666666666\" cy=\"104\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"ip-dot p1\"/><text x=\"298.06666666666666\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"ip-label p1\">2b = 6</text>\n  </svg>\n        <p class=\"ip-rule\"><span class=\"ip-tag\">规则</span><span data-math-text><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&lt;b,\\ c&gt;0\\Rightarrow ac&lt;bc</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span><small data-math-text>从原点向外拉伸，顺序不变；除以正数也一样。</small></p>\n      </section><section class=\"ip-panel\" data-ip-panel=\"mulneg\" hidden>\n        <p class=\"ip-example\"><span data-math-text><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1&lt;3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span>，</span>两边乘 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"ip-verdict flip\">方向改变</span></p>\n        <svg class=\"ip-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 138\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"两边乘负数：上面是原来的两个数，下面是运算后的两个数\">\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"38\" class=\"ip-row\">原来</text>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"108\" class=\"ip-row\">之后</text>\n    <path d=\"M58 34H332\" class=\"ip-line\"/><path d=\"M64 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M87.81818181818181 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M111.63636363636364 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M135.45454545454544 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M159.27272727272728 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M183.0909090909091 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M206.9090909090909 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M230.72727272727272 28V40\" class=\"ip-tick zero\"/><path d=\"M254.54545454545456 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M278.3636363636364 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M302.1818181818182 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M326 31V37\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M58 104H332\" class=\"ip-line\"/><path d=\"M64 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M87.81818181818181 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M111.63636363636364 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M135.45454545454544 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M159.27272727272728 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M183.0909090909091 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M206.9090909090909 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M230.72727272727272 98V110\" class=\"ip-tick zero\"/><path d=\"M254.54545454545456 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M278.3636363636364 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M302.1818181818182 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/><path d=\"M326 101V107\" class=\"ip-tick\"/>\n    <text x=\"230.72727272727272\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ip-zero\">0</text>\n    <path d=\"M254.54545454545456 40L183.0909090909091 98\" class=\"ip-connector p0\"/><path d=\"M302.1818181818182 40L87.81818181818181 98\" class=\"ip-connector p1\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"254.54545454545456\" cy=\"34\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"ip-dot p0\"/><text x=\"247.54545454545456\" y=\"23\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"ip-label p0\">a = 1</text><circle cx=\"302.1818181818182\" cy=\"34\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"ip-dot p1\"/><text x=\"309.1818181818182\" y=\"23\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"ip-label p1\">b = 3</text><circle cx=\"183.0909090909091\" cy=\"104\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"ip-dot p0\"/><text x=\"190.0909090909091\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"ip-label p0\">−2a = −2</text><circle cx=\"87.81818181818181\" cy=\"104\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"ip-dot p1\"/><text x=\"80.81818181818181\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"ip-label p1\">−2b = −6</text>\n  </svg>\n        <p class=\"ip-rule\"><span class=\"ip-tag\">规则</span><span data-math-text><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&lt;b,\\ c&lt;0\\Rightarrow ac&gt;bc</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span><small data-math-text>先翻到原点另一侧，顺序颠倒；除以负数也一样。</small></p>\n      </section><section class=\"ip-panel\" data-ip-panel=\"recip\" hidden>\n        <p class=\"ip-example\"><span data-math-text><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1&lt;3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span>，</span>两边取倒数</span><span class=\"ip-verdict flip\">方向改变</span></p>\n        <svg class=\"ip-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 138\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"两边取倒数：上面是原来的两个数，下面是运算后的两个数\">\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"38\" class=\"ip-row\">原来</text>\n    <text x=\"8\" y=\"108\" class=\"ip-row\">之后</text>\n    <path d=\"M58 34H332\" class=\"ip-line\"/><path d=\"M96.75 28V40\" class=\"ip-tick zero\